<div align="center">

## ✨ What is FlixBase?

</div>

> **FlixBase** is a self-hosted, community-driven cinematic hub where anyone can discover movies, web series, and anime — with direct download links, streaming options, games, modded apps, and a community request system. **100% free, no subscriptions, no login required.**

---

