## 📁 Project Structure

</div>

```
FlixBase/
├── 📄 pages/
│   ├── index.jsx          ← 🏠 Home — Hero, Search, Movie Grid
│   ├── submit.jsx         ← ➕ Add Movie (OMDB auto-fill)
│   ├── requests.jsx       ← 📥 Request & Upvote Movies
│   ├── collection.jsx     ← ❤️ Personal Saved Collection
│   ├── games.jsx          ← 🎮 Games & Modded Apps
│   ├── finder.jsx         ← 🔍 Movie Finder
│   ├── live.jsx           ← 📺 Live IPL Matches
│   ├── contact.jsx        ← 📧 Contact Us
│   ├── support.jsx        ← 💙 Support & Share
│   └── movies/[id].jsx    ← 🎬 Movie Detail Page
│   └── games/[id].jsx     ← 🎮 Game Detail Page
│
├── 🧩 components/
│   ├── Navbar.jsx              ← Navigation Bar
│   ├── MovieCard.jsx           ← 3D Tilt Card
│   ├── SearchBar.jsx           ← Animated Search
│   ├── AddMovieForm.jsx        ← Movie Form
│   └── CinematicBackground.jsx ← Canvas Animation
│
├── 🔧 lib/
│   └── supabase.js        ← All Database Functions
│
├── 🎨 styles/
│   └── globals.css        ← Dark Theme + Animations
│
└── 🗄️ supabase/
    └── schema.sql         ← Run this first!
```

