## 📖 Pages Overview

</div>

| Page | URL | Description |
|------|-----|-------------|
| 🏠 Home | `/` | Hero + Search + Movie Grid |
| 🎬 Movie | `/movies/[id]` | Detail + Download + Stream |
| ➕ Add Movie | `/submit` | OMDB Auto-fill Form |
| ❤️ Collection | `/collection` | Browser Saved Favourites |
| 📥 Requests | `/requests` | Submit & Upvote |
| 🎮 Games | `/games` | Games & Modded APKs |
| 🔍 Finder | `/finder` | Find Movie on Sites |
| 📺 Live | `/live` | Live IPL Matches |
| 📧 Contact | `/contact` | Contact Form |
| 💙 Support | `/support` | Share FlixBase |

